{%- comment -%}
  Quick view — the panel's contents, rendered on demand.

  Deliberately schema-less, exactly like sections/predictive-search.liquid: a
  merchant never places this, it only answers theme.js's request for
  `<product url>?section_id=quick-view`. Because that request is made against
  the product's own URL, `product` here is the real product object and every
  price, translation and image size is Liquid's.

  The wrapper is what the script looks for — it takes the inner HTML and drops
  it into the overlay shell in snippets/quick-view.liquid.
{%- endcomment -%}

<div data-quick-view-inner>
  {%- if product != blank -%}
    {% render 'quick-view-contents', product: product %}
  {%- endif -%}
</div>
